// GA4-DATA-API-1 (2026-10-18, pillar reach): GA4 G-LV7RHRVW6R has been collected through Zaraz on qnfo.org, q08.org,
// qwav.tech, ipatent.me and empoweringchange.today and never read (docs/STRATEGY.md s1 "collected, never read"); the
// GA4-READ-1 helpers here were empty stubs, so reachIngestTick called a function that returned undefined every day. This
// reads the GA4 Data API (properties.runReport) with the service account in the GA4_SA_KEY secret (JSON key; scope
// analytics.readonly; RS256 JWT signed with WebCrypto, no library): per host the page views, active users, sessions and
// engaged sessions, and per session source the sessions, for one complete UTC day. Rows go to reach_signals source ga4
// (quality human: GA4 drops known bots). Once per day on the cloud_ops_events row ga4-ingest-<day>, at most 3 attempts.
// A missing key, a refused grant (403) or a quota error writes no number, only that row with its reason, so the
// scorecard keeps reading GA4 as not connected instead of zero. Property id: ops_config ga4_property_id, else the default.
var GA4_SCOPE = "https://www.googleapis.com/auth/analytics.readonly";
