// ARCH-OVERDUE-LOOPS-1 (agent_issues 100124): whether a loop's last tick is late is judged against its own schedule. archCadenceMin(exprs) is
// the largest gap in minutes between consecutive fires of a worker's crons over one week; null when an expression is not parseable or pins a
// day of the month or a month (the gap is then not a week's pattern). Cloudflare cron day-of-week is 1-7 with 1 = Sunday (SUN-SAT also
